{"id":"meren","name":"Meren","type":"character","aliases":["Meren Deathbender","Meren of Clan Nel Toth"],"description":"Human necromancer from Jund on Alara, exiled by her clan, who learned necromancy on Grixis and took vengeance.","pages":3,"first_seen":"2015-11-04","last_seen":"2015-11-13","description_citations":[{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Meren","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Meren","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Meren","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Meren\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."}],"bio":null,"timeline":[{"id":"all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04-e0","era":null,"summary":"Meren, an apprentice shaman, is anointed by the Circle of Nel Toth with the Dreamfire Draught for her trial to become a full shaman.","participants":["meren","elder-shaman","kael","circle-of-nel-toth","dreamfire-draught"],"location":"jund","importance":"major","page":"stories/all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04","order":522,"story_date":"2015-11-04","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":9,"quote":"We of the Circle of Nel Toth anoint you, Meren, child of stone and blood and bone, with the Dreamfire Draught.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04#:~:text=We%20of%20the%20Circle,with%20the%20Dreamfire%20Draught.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"All the Cairns of Jund","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Michael Yichao"],"date":"2015-11-04","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04#:~:text=We%20of%20the%20Circle,with%20the%20Dreamfire%20Draught.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"All the Cairns of Jund\" by Michael Yichao. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 4 Nov 2015."}},{"id":"all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04-e1","era":null,"summary":"Meren drinks the via