stood%20haltingly.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"All the Cairns of Jund","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Michael Yichao"],"date":"2015-11-04","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04#:~:text=The%20shaman%20rose%20from,ground%20and%20stood%20haltingly.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"All the Cairns of Jund\" by Michael Yichao. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 4 Nov 2015."}},{"id":"all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04-e5","era":null,"summary":"Meren forces the dead shaman to point the way to the clan's new convening caves and sets her Borrowed party marching.","participants":["meren","borrowed-ones"],"location":"jund","importance":"minor","page":"stories/all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04","order":522,"story_date":"2015-11-04","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":58,"quote":"Where are the new convening caves of the Circle.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04#:~:text=Where%20are%20the%20new,caves%20of%20the%20Circle.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"All the Cairns of Jund","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Michael Yichao"],"date":"2015-11-04","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04#:~:text=Where%20are%20the%20new,caves%20of%20the%20Circle.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"All the Cairns of Jund\" by Michael Yichao. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 4 Nov 2015."}},{"id":"all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04-e6","era":null,"summary":"Flashback: the elemental recoils from Meren's greeting, breaks her arm and ribs, and she shelters in a stone dome as it rages.","participants":["meren","kael","circle-of-nel-toth"],"location":"jund","importance":"minor","page":"storie